{'symbol': 'ODFL', 'date': '2023-05-01 16:05:00', 'title': 'OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE ANNOUNCES NEW EXECUTIVE OFFICER', 'text': "THOMASVILLE, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE, INC. (NASDAQ: ODFL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY, ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED CHRISTOPHER J. KELLEY, WHO CURRENTLY SERVES AS THE COMPANY'S VICE PRESIDENT – CENTRAL STATES REGION, TO SERVE AS THE COMPANY'S SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT – OPERATIONS. GREG C. GANTT, THE COMPANY'S PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, SAID, “THIS PROMOTION REFLECTS CHRIS' OUTSTANDING PRIOR CONTRIBUTIONS TO OUR COMPANY AND OUR CONFIDENCE IN."}